 "method_note": "Hamilton (1989) Markov switching with regime-specific intercept, credit beta and variance: a calm regime with a small credit beta and a stress regime (2001, 2008, 2020) with a large negative one (returns in percent). The smoothed regime probabilities date the stress episodes. Baa-10Y is Moody's via FRED (long history; ICE BofA OAS start 2023 in our lake). Caveat: the universe is today's constituents (membership history starts 2026-10), so early years carry survivorship bias; read the premium as an upper bound.",
